      "source_hash": "d7aefb65aea17ddffdeb35d87bfc9344d07a2c9e3d32332db54ca62592ad98fc",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Summarises global progress in National Health Workforce Accounts (NHWA) implementation across 206 countries, territories, and areas (including 98% of WHO Member States), estimating a global health and care workforce of 70.9 million in 2024 and highlighting workforce inequalities and ageing trends through 2030.",
