      "source": "sections/sec-006-13-about-this-report.md",
      "source_hash": "d698917dcaaf0dd1671d389de26e91e829a8ff32db31e327dc90cb6676c28023",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Outlines the purpose and structure of this inaugural annual report on global and regional health workforce levels and trends, covering NHWA implementation progress, global and regional workforce estimates, demographic and workforce ageing analyses, and methodological annexes.",
