    {
      "block": "library/9789240122925-eng/blocks/prose-sec-009",
      "source": "sections/sec-009-22-status-of-nhwa-focal-points-in-2025.md",
      "source_hash": "675a577c3e118fb09fad4581c3194786e810fcabf7dc973e7232e817154df534",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Reports that as of December 2025, 206 countries, territories, and areas — including 190 of the 194 WHO Member States (98%) — have appointed national NHWA focal points or report data through the joint OECD/Eurostat/WHO-Europe data collection mechanism.",
          "lang": "en",
