      "source": "sections/sec-014-4-thematic-analysis-population-and-health-workfo.md",
      "source_hash": "7d1ac235f3aab9466fe04315ca87fc5cd1d857218ca78e5527c88fd56e341513",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Chapter title and overview introducing Chapter 4, which analyses the combined impact of global population ageing and health workforce ageing on future health workforce requirements.",
